<title>INDIA: India's Sterlite 96/97 net higher.</title>
<headline>India's Sterlite 96/97 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	   1,401.6 vs  1,148.7</p>
<p>    Turnover	    10,066.7 vs  7,208.9</p>
<p>    Gross profit	 1,598.8 vs  1,359.5</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   176.1 vs    150.8</p>
<p>    Taxation		  21.1 vs     60.0</p>
<p>Note: Cable maker Sterlite Industries (India) Ltd the result includes three months of operations of Sterlite Communications which has merged with Sterlite Industries.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom (91-22-265 9000)</p>
</text>
